The build process should create the 16x16 tileset in a file called
tiles.bmp (which is later included in the slashem.exe file). Can you
see if this file exists in your build directory and if so use some
existing application to view it and see if it is corrupted, please?

If it is corrupted then it might be worth trying to delete the file
and re-run the build process so it gets re-created. If this still
doesn't help then check and see if any errors are reported by
tile2bmp during the build.

